#N canvas 40 40 1180 1130 12;
#X text 40 20 dx7~  patch browser;
#X text 40 46 scan a folder of .syx banks and step through the voices. Mark favourites and save them. Morph between two sounds., f 100;
#X text 40 110 1  LIBRARY;
#X msg 40 140 \; dx7h lib scan sysex;
#X text 40 178 click the box to scan. Edit the folder name first: it is read next to this patch or write a full path. Sub-folders are included and duplicates are skipped., f 58;
